    <innerclass refid="structterminal_1_1_link_span" prot="public">terminal::LinkSpan</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespaceterminal">terminal</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Data struct representing a single detected link span on the terminal viewport. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A LinkSpan records the grid coordinates, resolved URI, type, and hint label for one file path or <ref refid="classURL" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">URL</ref> found during an on-demand viewport scan. It is produced by <computeroutput>terminal::Display::scanViewportForLinks()</computeroutput> and stored in <computeroutput>terminal::Display::activeLinks</computeroutput> for the duration of an open-file modal session.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>LinkDetector </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>terminal::Display::scanViewportForLinks </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
